uation inside strings, does removing that change anything?\n\nI didn't quite understand the question, what do I need to do and how to test it?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872576887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872657015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872657015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872657015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgmidw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:03:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:03:01Z","body":"```\nFLAGS=\"optimize=size_extra lto=full deprecated=no\n  forward_plus_renderer=yes forward_mobile_renderer=no opengl3=no d3d12=no\n  accesskit=no angle=no engine_update_check=no disable_xr=yes\n  builtin_openxr=no module_mobile_vr_enabled=no module_openxr_enabled=no\n  module_visionos_xr_enabled=no module_webxr_enabled=no\"\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872657015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872705281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872705281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872705281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgpfAQ","user":{"login":"TOWUK","id":28830162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODMwMTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28830162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK","html_url":"https://github.com/TOWUK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:05:16Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:05:16Z","body":"> ```\n> FLAGS=\"optimize=size_extra lto=full deprecated=no\n>   forward_plus_renderer=yes forward_mobile_renderer=no opengl3=no d3d12=no\n>   accesskit=no angle=no engine_update_check=no disable_xr=yes\n>   builtin_openxr=no module_mobile_vr_enabled=no module_openxr_enabled=no\n>   module_visionos_xr_enabled=no module_webxr_enabled=no\"\n> ```\n\nroot@DESKTOP-0MJ1PMI:~/godot# nano build.sh\nroot@DESKTOP-0MJ1PMI:~/godot# ./build.sh\nscons: Reading SConscript files ...\nUsing linker program: mold\nPackage openxr was not found in the pkg-config search path.\nPerhaps you should add the directory containing `openxr.pc'\nto the PKG_CONFIG_PATH environment variable\nPackage 'openxr' not found\nOSError: 'pkg-config openxr --cflags --libs' exited 1:\n  File \"/root/godot/SConstruct\", line 732:\n    detect.configure(env)\n  File \"/root/godot/platform/linuxbsd/detect.py\", line 337:\n    env.ParseConfig(\"pkg-config openxr --cflags --libs\")\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/SCons/Environment.py\", line 1808:\n    return function(self, self.backtick(command), unique)\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/SCons/Environment.py\", line 793:\n    raise OSError(f'{command!r} exited {cp.returncode}')\nroot@DESKTOP-0MJ1PMI:~/godot#\n\n<img width=\"1491\" height=\"443\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b08ebcf-a6de-4d2d-bfc7-0225d63ca561\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872705281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872744378","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872744378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872744378,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgr3ug","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:07:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:07:04Z","body":"I'd suggest just not enabling `builtin_openxr=no` if you aren't using it, doing so will make the engine try to look it up, it might be a bug that it looks it up even if it's unused though, but using `builtin_openxr=no` shouldn't give any benefits here","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872744378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872783162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872783162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872783162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXguPOg","user":{"login":"TOWUK","id":28830162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODMwMTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28830162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK","html_url":"https://github.com/TOWUK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TOWUK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:08:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:12:01Z","body":"> I'd suggest just not enabling `builtin_openxr=no` if you aren't using it, doing so will make the engine try to look it up, it might be a bug that it looks it up even if it's unused though, but using `builtin_openxr=no` shouldn't give any benefits here\n\nyes, but then why does scons perceive it incorrectly?\nthe screenshot shows that everything is ok if you remove this option.\n\n<img width=\"965\" height=\"748\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f12a05b-7ee2-4087-98c4-004a2613119c\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872783162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872835139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872835139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872835139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgxaQw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:11:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:13:20Z","body":"There's an error when it doesn't find what it was told to look for, that might be something to treat as a bug, but there's no reason to use `builtin_openxr=no` if you're not trying to provide your own openxr configuration separately\n\nMaking the engine check if it needs the xr libraries before trying to look them up might be a problem and might cause bugs or fragile systems, when there's no reason to do so\n\nTo be clear: `builtin_openxr=no` does *not* mean \"don't include openxr\", it means \"use an external openxr configuration\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872835139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872876233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123928#issuecomment-5872876233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123928","id":5872876233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgz6yQ","user":{"login":"TOWUK","id":28830162,"node_id":